#. module: l10n_ir_account
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ir_account
msgid ""
"===============\n"
"IRAN Accounting\n"
"===============\n"
"\n"
".. !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-OCA%2Fl10n--iran-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/l10n-iran/tree/19.0/l10n_ir_account\n"
"    :alt: OCA/l10n-iran\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"This module provides the **Iranian Chart of Accounts** for Odoo 19.0,\n"
"including:\n"
"\n"
"- **385 account templates** organized in 72 account groups (all in Persian)\n"
"- **VAT 10%** tax configuration (sale and purchase)\n"
"- **Iranian fiscal position** with auto-apply\n"
"- **IRR currency** (Iranian Rial) with symbol ریال\n"
"- **23 Iranian banks** pre-configured\n"
"- **Default property accounts** for receivable, payable, income, expense,\n"
"  currency exchange, POS, and cash differences\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"To install this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Clone the OCA/l10n-iran repository\n"
"#. Add the repository path to your Odoo addons path\n"
"#. Install the ``l10n_ir_account`` module from the Apps menu\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"After installation:\n"
"\n"
"#. Go to **Invoicing > Configuration > Settings**\n"
"#. Verify that the **Iranian Chart of Accounts** is selected\n"
"#. The chart is automatically loaded as the default for Iran (``base.ir``)\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-iran/issues>`_.\n"
